WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Guile uses parry into raw Drive Rush toward the corner.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.500
Standing heavy kick hits Manon in the corner.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.150
Crouching medium punch links after the Rush kick.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.350
OD Sonic Boom starts the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Somersault Kick finishes the juggle.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Manon falls beside the corner.
